Z||000008||Haze_Performance||12-24-2001||01:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Screwie:<BR><B>Well, I can use it for Midtown Madness, Midtown Madness 2, NFS 4, Colin McRae Rally 2, Insane, Viper Racing and some other games. So basically, I can use it in most race games.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>But I'm mainly going to use it for MM2 though.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't know ANYTHING about this stuff but... I have Midtown Madness "Chicago Edition"  Will this work for me?? & I hate to bug you but.. How do I get it onto my game??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">         <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Pace Car |FOR SALE|||65.230.195.221||reg||11
